e app', 'Add the Notes List widget to the home screen', 'Confirm the widget works normally', 'Log out of the app', 'Tap the widget on the home screen'], 'expected_behavior': \"The widget should show 'Log in to use widget' and open the login screen when tapped.\", 'actual_behavior': 'A new note is opened and the widget becomes blank.'}\n\n### [Functionality-driven COT]\nLet's think step by step.\n1. Function Identification: The tested function is tr__44.\n2. Expected Path: Please predict the exploration steps for this function based on the above information.\n3. Actual Path: The tested function sequence is as follows:\n(1) The 1st page is Navigate up, AnkiDroid, 273 cards due (32 min), Sync (log in), More options, Default, 3, 0 + click feature=\"Default\"\n(2) The 2nd page is Navigate up, Default, 0 minutes left, Undo, Flag card, Add note, More options, 3 + click feature=\"com.ichi2.anki:id/bottom_area_layout\"\n(3) The 3rd page is Navigate up, Default, 0 minutes left, Undo, Flag card, Add note, More options, 3 + click feature=\"EASY\"\n(4) The 4th page is Navigate up, Default, 0 minutes left, Undo, Flag card, Add note, More options, 2 + back\n(5) The 5th page is Navigate up, AnkiDroid, 272 cards due (36 min), Sync (log in), More options, Default, 2, 0 + click feature=\"Navigate up\"\n(6) The 6th page is Decks, Card browser, Statistics, Night mode, OFF, Settings, Help, Send feedback + click feature=\"Card browser\"\n(7) The 7th page is Navigate up, Default, 3 cards shown, Add note, Search, More options, Question, Answer + click feature=\"com.ichi2.anki:id/browser_column2_spinner\"\n(8) The 8th page is Answer, Card, Deck, Note, Question, Tags, Lapses, Reviews + click feature=\"Due\"\n(9) The 9th page is Navigate up, Default, 3 cards shown, Add note, Search, More options, Question, Due + long-click feature=\"testQ2\"\n(10) The 10th page is Navigate up, 1, Flag card, Mark notes, More options, Question, Due, testQ2 + click feature=\"More options\"\n(11) The 11th page is 